      "created_at": "2021-05-05T19:18:08.985Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dpt\" data-post=\"6\" data-topic=\"28473\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/48/1922_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dpt:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Dr. Medico started out that way, right?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, a joke in <a href=\"https://forum.greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/why-no-healers\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">a forum thread</a>. “Why isn’t there a dedicated healer?” Here’s why, but if we did we could do a being of pure energy called Doctor Medico MD (with the joke being that his name is basically “doctor” 4 times) which Adam then drew up real quick.</p>",
